gn="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="103" valign="bottom" style="width: 77.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;     &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 13.2013%"&gt;   &lt;td width="343" valign="top" style="width: 257.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Operating expenses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;24,093&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="30" colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="width: 22.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="103" valign="top" style="width: 77.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;25,038&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;     &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 13.2013%"&gt;   &lt;td width="343" valign="top" style="width: 257.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in" class=""&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Transportation and compression   expenses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;91,068&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="30" colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="width: 22.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="103" valign="top" style="width: 77.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in" class=""&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;90,897&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;     &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 13.2013%"&gt;   &lt;td width="343" valign="top" style="width: 257.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Compressor equipment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;1,747&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="30" colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="width: 22.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;      &lt;td width="103" valign="top" style="width: 77.4pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 0.25in"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 0 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;1,113&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;     &lt;/tr&gt;    &lt;tr style="height: 6.93069%"&gt;   &lt;td width="343" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="4" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="2" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="103" style="border: none"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;   &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(1) Primarily represents corporate charges and services provided by Energy Transfer and its subsidiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(2) Transportation and compression of gas services are from Trunkline Gas Company, LLC and Panhandle Eastern Pipe Line Company, LP, both are indirect subsidiaries of Energy Transfer. These expenses are reflected on the statement of income in operation expenses.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;(3) Compressor equipmentparts and related servicesprovided by SEC Energy Products &amp;amp; Services, L.P., an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Energy Transfer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Accounts receivable from and accounts payable to associated companies primarily relates to activities with Rover Holdco, transportation of natural gas, and various operating and administrative services provided by Energy Transfer and its subsidiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Rover paid cash distributions to its Members of $401 million and $429 million during the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Rover has transportation and exchange gas receivables and payables with various associated companies as a result of differences in volumes of gas received and delivered for those associated companies. The imbalances are settled based on the operator balancing agreements that Rover has with those associated companies. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 12pt 0.25in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span&gt;The following table sets forth the balances with associated companies within transportation and exchange gas payables reflected in Miscellaneous current and accrued liabilities, Account 242, on the balance sheet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" widt